  "name": "conduit",
  "description": "A high-performance Matrix homeserver implementation written in Rust, leveraging the Ruma crate for spec-compliant type definitions and Axum for its asynchronous web interface. It prioritizes resource efficiency and deployment simplicity, featuring a modular database abstraction layer that supports multiple key-value backends including RocksDB, Sled, and SQLite. The architecture implements core Matrix primitives such as federated state resolution, persistent data units (PDUs), and appservice integration for extensible communication bridging.",
